; P2 binary key-rotation join (ours) vs ProductZipper+unify (upstream).
; (eb $w 3) stores a VARIABLE at the join key position (eb arg1).
; CONTROL: (ea 9 8)+(eb 8 7) -> ground key 8 present in both keymaps.
; DISCRIMINATOR: (ea 1 2)+(eb $w 3) needs $y=2 to unify with the stored var.
(ea 1 2)
(ea 9 8)
(eb $w 3)
(eb 8 7)
(exec 0 (, (ea $x $y) (eb $y $z)) (, (out $x $y $z)))
